# Moonlight Syndrome (SLPS-01001), the chapter in FUYOU.DAT on disc 2 (SLPS-01002). This chapter's kanji and marks,
# 0x0100-0x02FF (6 codes in that range have no glyph), in the order of the chapter's font on the disc (the
# archive's entry 3); 16-bit codes, high byte first. Goes after tables/human-kana.tbl (the codes every chapter
# shares).
# Read by eye from the font, then checked in this and the other chapters' script words. 462 of the 506 are used by
